│   ├── hooks/                  # Function detour hooks and guest patches
│   ├── host_audio.*            # Host audio streaming
│   ├── host_input.*            # Gamepad and keyboard input handling
│   ├── upscaler/ & shader/     # Rendering pipelines and post-processing
