│   │   │   ├── mdl/            # 3D model parsing & GLTF mesh conversion
│   │   │   ├── equipment/      # Weapon, clothing, item indexes
│   │   │   └── entities/       # Entity definitions and indexes
│   │   ├── launcher/           # Launcher UI, settings, and modding management panel
│   │   └── game/               # In-game HUD, UI, and host presentation nodes
│   ├── addons/
│   │   └── bnk_mount/          # In-editor live asset browser, inspector & mod creator
│   ├── assets/
│   │   └── mods/               # Target folder for .f2mod mod packages (no loose folders)
│   ├── docs/                   # Architecture and unit testing guides
│   └── tests/
│       └── Refii.Tests/        # Automated GdUnit4Net test project
├── notes/                      # User's research documentation, format specs, modding design
└── tools/                      # Python/shell tools (disassemblers, debuggers, contracts)
```

